<BaseLayout title="Site privacy — Deffy"><article class="inside">
 <PageHeading eyebrow="A little clarity" title="Your visit, your space."/>
 <div class="prose"><p>This preview uses no analytics, advertising trackers, embedded streams, or automatic audio. Fonts and illustrations are served locally.</p><h2>A small preference.</h2><p>When you choose a movement setting, the site tries to remember it in this browser’s local storage. It contains your chosen setting, not a visitor identifier. The site still works when storage is unavailable.</p><p>Your system’s reduced-motion preference takes priority. You can change movement using the settings control in the header.</p><h2>Other destinations.</h2><p>Links to Twitch, Kick, GitHub, and independent projects take you to separate services with their own practices. They are not embedded into this preview.</p><p>No contact form submits information from this preview.</p></div>
</article></BaseLayout>

